ht=\"654\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e365502b-dec0-45c2-b10c-48b4e8c60c34\" />\n\n<img width=\"232\" height=\"74\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/18a24b8d-5443-45db-8ba5-1a41da5cf754\" />\n\nMaybe not relevant, but I had the exact same thing happen in Unreal Engine editor before, iirc I could fix it by switching from the default rendering backend (dx12?) to another (dx11?). \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n2. Not sure which actions trigger it, so far importing textures or dragging them from the FileSystem dock usually did. Just now opening a material resource did it.\n3. Tooltips stay broken until Godot is restarted.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nHappened in this project, also in a different one, but I have not found a surefire way to trigger it. [modular-dungeon.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24643936/modular-dungeon.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"ThePagi","id":32794457,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzk0NDU3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32794457?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePagi","html_url":"https://github.com/ThePagi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePagi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePagi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePagi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePagi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePagi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePagi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePagi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePagi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThePagi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114988/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"